(`IsPolyRootMax.isPolynomialSystemMax`). A solution of a system gives a zero of its root's system in the box of Krawczyk's test, which is the only one (`Root.exists_scale`): that fixes the scale, the pose, the translation and the multipliers; the generator is the only root of its equation in its interval, and each coordinate is fixed by its equation (`Root.IsSystemOf.oneRoot`, `Modules/Root/HasUniqueRoot.lean`). The maximum is that of `johnsonBigyrateDiminishedRhombicosidodecahedron_exact_list`: each completed system has the scales of its written-out system (`Root.IsSystemOf.scales_eq`).
